e. Every player of a club moves by one whole number and its best few by one more, held to 1–99 and never past a teammate rated above him, whichever brings the club nearest its target: −4 to +4 points this season. The results count twice, by design: the credit's points for and against place a club's players at their positions and weigh its offence against its defence, and the move then sets the club's level from its margins, wherever the credit left it. Facts from Pro Football Archives; the weights tuned once on 2001–2005 against the next season's Madden launch ratings, then frozen."},"map":"nfl1999","clubs":[{"id":"nfl-st-louis-rams","name":"St. Louis Rams","code":"STL","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 102)","str":84.3,"squad":[["Kurt Warner","QB",96],["Paul Justin","QB",53],["Marshall Faulk","RB",95],["Robert Holcombe","RB",74],["Isaac Bruce","WR",88],["Torry Holt","WR",77],["Az-Zahir Hakim","WR",70],["Ricky Proehl","WR",65],["Roland Williams","TE",83],["Jeff Robinson","TE",71],["Adam Timmerman","OL",96],["Fred Miller","OL",96],["Mike Gruttadauria","OL",96],["Orlando Pace","OL",96],["Tom Nutten","OL",77],["Andy McCollum","OL",57],["Ryan Tucker","OL",52],["Kevin Carter","DL",96],["Grant Wistrom","DL",85],["D'Marco Farr","DL",84],["Ray Agnew","DL",74],["Jeff Zgonina","DL",62],["Jay Williams","DL",60],["Mike Jones","LB",87],["London Fletcher","LB",82],["Todd Collins","LB",68],["Todd Lyght","CB",95],["Dexter McCleon","CB",80],["Dre' Bly","CB",66],["Taje Allen","CB",65],["Billy Jenkins","S",78],["Keith Lyle","S",68],["Devin Bush","S",67],["Jeff Wilkins","K",75]]},{"id":"nfl-indianapolis-colts","name":"Indianapolis Colts","code":"IND","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 65)","str":82.7,"squad":[["Peyton Manning","QB",91],["Steve Walsh","QB",51],["Edgerrin James","RB",98],["Paul Shields","RB",62],["Marvin Harrison","WR",97],["Terrence Wilkins","WR",75],["E.G. Green","WR",67],["Jerome Pathon","WR",64],["Ken Dilger","TE",83],["Marcus P